  ["Strong consistency for seats", "Survive huge spikes at sale opening", "Browsing can be eventually consistent"],
  "- Popular concert: 1M users in the first minute for 50k seats; normal load ~1k bookings/min.",
  """`GET /events?city=` · `GET /shows/{id}/seats` · `POST /holds {showId, seatIds}` → holdId, expiresAt · `POST /bookings {holdId, paymentToken, idempotencyKey}`""",
  """SQL: `seats(show_id, seat_id, status[AVAILABLE|HELD|BOOKED], hold_id, hold_expires_at, version)`; `bookings`, `payments`. Event catalogue + search in Elasticsearch; seat maps cached.""",
  {"rows": [["u:Users"], ["x:CDN + virtual waiting room"], ["Catalog/search service", "Booking service"], ["c:Seat map cache", "db:Seats/Bookings DB (SQL)", "Payment service"], ["Hold expiry worker"]],
   "edges": [["Users", "CDN + virtual waiting room"], ["CDN + virtual waiting room", "Catalog/search service"], ["CDN + virtual waiting room", "Booking service", "admitted users"], ["Booking service", "Seats/Bookings DB (SQL)", "conditional update"], ["Booking service", "Payment service"], ["Catalog/search service", "Seat map cache"], ["Hold expiry worker", "Seats/Bookings DB (SQL)", "release expired"]]},
  ["Hold: `UPDATE seats SET status='HELD', hold_id=?, hold_expires_at=now()+10m WHERE show_id=? AND seat_id IN (...) AND status='AVAILABLE'` — all rows must update, else roll back (seat taken).",
   "Pay with idempotency key; on success mark BOOKED in a transaction; on failure/expiry release (worker or lazy check of `hold_expires_at`)."],
